WEBVTT

00:01:28.390 --> 00:01:36.880 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.990 line:0%
[Episode 16]

00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:41.630 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice]

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:46.450 line:0%
You didn't sleep well, did you?

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:50.680 line:0%
I told you to come home with me, but you wouldn't listen.

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:51.520 line:0%
You said

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:53.160 line:0%
you wanted to go to the History Archive to find clues.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.040 line:0%
I guess you not only didn't find any clues,

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:56.779 line:0%
but you did manage to catch a cold.

00:01:56.779 --> 00:01:57.890 line:0%
Don't even mention it.

00:01:57.890 --> 00:01:59.089 line:0%
There's too much.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.730 line:0%
There're so many records.

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:02.560 line:0%
Those people really know how to write.

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:03.960 line:0%
They would record anything,

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:05.370 line:0%
even the tiniest details.

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:08.200 line:0%
You spent the whole night reading the files, right?

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:09.600 line:0%
I couldn't sleep anyway.

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:11.800 line:0%
I think

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:14.200 line:0%
you should go back to Shen's Mansion first.

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:14.960 line:0%
At worst,

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:16.320 line:0%
you'll have to say a few nice words

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.920 line:0%
to Grand Commander Shen.

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:19.280 line:0%
Why should I?

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:21.980 line:0%
I really think you should.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:23.160 line:0%
Yesterday, I

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:25.360 line:0%
witnessed everything with my own eyes.

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:26.680 line:0%
This time,

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:27.600 line:0%
you might have really

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:28.720 line:0%
misunderstood him a bit.

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:30.720 line:0%
What did I misunderstand about him?

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:32.220 line:0%
The day you were arrested,

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:34.120 line:0%
Lai Luozhi arrived quickly.

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:35.640 line:0%
Fortunately, Grand Commander Shen

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:36.840 line:0%
also arrived in time.

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:39.690 line:0%
You cleared your name so quickly

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:40.600 line:0%
thanks to

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:42.080 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:01.590 line:0%
It's only been a few days,

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.560 line:0%
yet there're already so many new sects

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:05.090 line:0%
which claim that they know how to

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:06.790 line:0%
bring the dead back

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:08.280 line:0%
to life and achieve immortality.

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:09.740 line:0%
We've already sent people to investigate thoroughly.

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:10.540 line:0%
However,

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:11.910 line:0%
most of them preach randomly,

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:13.220 line:0%
mainly spreading heretical teachings.

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:15.480 line:0%
It's difficult to track their next move.

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:17.940 line:0%
Fire Moth Sect?

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:19.010 line:0%
Of all sects,

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:20.070 line:0%
the Fire Moth Sect

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.440 line:0%
can be said to be the most dominant.

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:23.240 line:0%
Moreover, there are rumors that

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:24.650 line:0%
the core figure of the Fire Moth Sect

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:27.310 line:0%
is Chen Huo'e, who was supposedly resurrected.

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:31.720 line:0%
Mom.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:33.680 line:0%
Let's leave.

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:35.510 line:0%
I haven't finished praying yet.

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:37.450 line:0%
Xing, you...

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:39.740 line:0%
Mom.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.160 line:0%
What are you doing here?

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:43.930 line:0%
I came to pray for blessings for you and your father.

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:45.879 line:0%
Don't believe everything you hear.

00:03:45.879 --> 00:03:46.440 line:0%
Let's go quickly.

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:46.920 line:0%
Let's leave right away.

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:47.840 line:0%
No, no, it's about to...

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.440 line:0%
-It’ll work soon.
-Let’s go.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:54.850 line:0%
What's going on here?

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:56.600 line:0%
Attention, everyone.

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.120 line:0%
You are not allowed to gather here without reason.

00:03:58.120 --> 00:03:58.840 line:0%
Disperse immediately.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.200 line:0%
Why should we leave?

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.400 line:0%
We haven't done anything wrong.

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.940 line:0%
Those who obstruct the Fire Moth Sect

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:04.340 line:0%
will be punished by gods.

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:05.640 line:0%
Arrest them all.

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:06.740 line:0%
You people

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:08.290 line:0%
will be punished by gods!

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.340 line:0%
You will be punished by gods!

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:12.620 line:0%
You will be punished by gods!

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:14.300 line:0%
Let go of me!

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.100 line:0%
Let's go.

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:25.920 line:0%
Mother.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:27.330 line:0%
What were you doing there?

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:29.120 line:0%
It was so dangerous.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:30.500 line:0%
Keep your voice down.

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:31.680 line:0%
I was just

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:34.040 line:0%
praying for blessings for you and your father,

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.160 line:0%
so that you may live a long life,

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.000 line:0%
and be free from disasters and difficulties.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.720 line:0%
That's all a scam.

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:40.520 line:0%
Throw that away...

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:41.640 line:0%
No, no, I can't.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:43.640 line:0%
If I do, I'll be punished by gods.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.040 line:0%
This is a holy object of the Fire Moth Sect.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.360 line:0%
It's an incarnation of the gods.

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:48.610 line:0%
It must not be violated.

00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:50.440 line:0%
All those who are disrespectful to the Fire Moth gods

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:51.680 line:0%
will be hanged,

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.120 line:0%
tied up in the shape of a moth,

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:54.640 line:0%
-and be punished with fire.
-Mother.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.160 line:0%
Where did you hear all this?

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:57.320 line:0%
Come on.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:59.330 line:0%
Even the children on the street know

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:00.900 line:0%
that those offending the Fire Moth Sect

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.990 line:0%
will end up being burned alive.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:04.960 line:0%
I can't believe this thing

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:06.920 line:0%
has already bewitched so many people.

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.720 line:0%
I must investigate this thoroughly.

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:09.520 line:0%
Mother.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.440 line:0%
If you continue to get involved with those things,

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:13.160 line:0%
you'll be in great danger.

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:14.680 line:0%
Listen to me.

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:15.880 line:0%
Stay at home.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:17.200 line:0%
And don't go anywhere for now.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:17.920 line:0%
I'll take this away.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:18.520 line:0%
No.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:19.910 line:0%
Give it back to me.

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:22.600 line:0%
You ungrateful daughter, give it back to me.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:23.400 line:0%
You little troublemaker.

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:24.880 line:0%
Then, don't be disrespectful.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.880 line:0%
And don't offend the Fire Moth Sect.

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:40.150 line:0%
[History Archive]

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:51.959 line:0%
It's so hot.

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:18.360 line:0%
There's a fire!

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:19.710 line:0%
The History Archive is on fire!

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:22.310 line:0%
-Fire!
-Fire!

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.210 line:0%
[History Archive]

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:23.440 line:0%
Hurry!

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:24.840 line:0%
Quickly, bring water!

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:25.780 line:0%
[History Archive]

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:25.960 line:0%
Get water here fast!

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:27.040 line:0%
Coming, coming!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.820 line:0%
[History Archive]

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:28.320 line:0%
Go get water quickly!

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:29.240 line:0%
Hurry up!

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:30.120 line:0%
Get water!

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:31.210 line:0%
This way, this way!

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.520 line:0%
Coming, coming! Hurry!

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:33.300 line:0%
[History Archive]

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:34.959 line:0%
Over here, over here!

00:06:34.959 --> 00:06:36.020 line:0%
Go again, go again!

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:38.370 line:0%
Xing...

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:46.840 line:0%
Xing!

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:50.160 line:0%
Quick!

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:55.840 line:0%
Bring water!

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:04.730 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:20.950 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:44.050 line:0%
♫Who will save me from my loneliness and confusion?♫

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:47.670 line:0%
♫Understanding my fragility, no words are needed♫

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:51.050 line:0%
♫Who will save me from my panic and obsession?♫

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:54.770 line:0%
♫Sheltering my solitude, never letting me fall♫

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:58.690 line:0%
♫The chains of fate between us cannot be broken♫

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:03.220 line:0%
♫Holding the warmth you once gave♫

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:08.530 line:0%
♫Guiding me to see myself, the person I truly am♫

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:12.600 line:0%
♫Who will save me from right and wrong?♫

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:15.910 line:0%
♫Tossed in the sea of people, just hold me tight♫

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:19.510 line:0%
♫Who will save me from grudges and karma?♫

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:22.830 line:0%
♫Healing my sorrow, never letting me escape♫

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:27.120 line:0%
♫The past fades, how many times have we met?♫

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:31.420 line:0%
♫Who can break free from destiny?♫

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:37.200 line:0%
♫I'll cross rivers and leap into fire for you♫

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:46.840 line:0%
Xing.

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:07.280 line:0%
♫I'm willing to disappear with you in the hustle and bustle♫

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.000 line:0%
You're awake.

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:43.400 line:0%
You inhaled a lot of smoke.

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.290 line:0%
You need to have a good rest.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:48.280 line:0%
I'm sorry.

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:52.570 line:0%
And thank you for saving me.

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:02.980 line:0%
Get some rest.

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:04.740 line:0%
Don't talk too much.

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:08.400 line:0%
Sometimes when I speak,

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:09.970 line:0%
I can be quite blunt.

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:12.280 line:0%
If I said something offensive,

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:13.960 line:0%
please don't take it to heart.

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:18.080 line:0%
I understand.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:36.540 line:0%
Do you think

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:39.380 line:0%
the fire was set by someone deliberately?

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:40.170 line:0%
Was it to destroy

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:41.960 line:0%
the county records and files inside?

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:43.420 line:0%
Or it was meant to kill you.

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:44.280 line:0%
To kill me?

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:47.680 line:0%
Are they afraid I'll find out the truth?

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:49.520 line:0%
I doubt we could find another person

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:51.440 line:0%
as bold as you.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:07.620 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:49.010 line:0%
I got this powder on my coat when saving you.

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:50.360 line:0%
What exactly is it?

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:54.210 line:0%
Perhaps only my master

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:55.480 line:0%
knows what this is.

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:02.340 line:0%
Be careful.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:10.670 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:12.970 line:0%
Are you feeling unwell?

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:19.200 line:0%
No.

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:21.470 line:0%
I-I-I'm fine.

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:22.720 line:0%
Now you know

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.380 line:0%
how dangerous it is out there.

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:28.920 line:0%
Get some rest.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:30.760 line:0%
Don't go anywhere.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:56.900 line:0%
[Jingshen Pavilion]

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:00.430 line:0%
Master.

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.840 line:0%
Just to have some tea,

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:03.560 line:0%
why do we have to come

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:04.760 line:0%
so far away here?

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:07.760 line:0%
It's only here

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:11.700 line:0%
that you can taste the flavor you want.

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:14.210 line:0%
Don't believe me? Try it yourself.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:18.070 line:0%
[Jingshen Pavilion]

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:18.560 line:0%
That's not the right way to drink tea.

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.600 line:0%
You're drinking too fast.

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:24.320 line:0%
Master.

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:26.050 line:0%
This is the powder found on the crime scene.

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:26.920 line:0%
It was also found

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:28.480 line:0%
near the original site of the Jinxiu Workshop.

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:29.920 line:0%
But we don't know where it was from.

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.660 line:0%
[Jingshen Pavilion]

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:42.730 line:0%
[Jingshen Pavilion]

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:46.940 line:0%
Don't smell it.

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.310 line:0%
Interesting.

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:00.740 line:0%
It's flammable.

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.760 line:0%
And it burns without leaving a trace.

00:14:02.760 --> 00:14:04.660 line:0%
This doesn't seem like something an ordinary sorcerer would use

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.520 line:0%
for their cultivation.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:08.530 line:0%
I'm afraid it might be

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:12.240 line:0%
something that came from foreign tribes.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:13.570 line:0%
From foreign tribes?

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:16.260 line:0%
Perhaps someone in the Ghost Market

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:17.600 line:0%
might know

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:19.280 line:0%
the origin of this thing.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:20.400 line:0%
Master.

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:22.640 line:0%
It's such a shame that you no longer solve cases

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:23.960 line:0%
with your skills

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:29.410 line:0%
[Jingshen Pavilion]

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:27.800 line:0%
Well, you've already learned

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:30.340 line:0%
most of my skills.

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:32.460 line:0%
Looks like

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:34.360 line:0%
it's time for me to retire.

00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:36.680 line:0%
At my age,

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:39.320 line:0%
I value peace and quiet.

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:41.040 line:0%
I just seize every day

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:44.180 line:0%
and enjoy my life.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:47.240 line:0%
Now I can leisurely enjoy tea every day,

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:54.290 line:0%
[Jingshen Pavilion]

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:48.680 line:0%
feeling carefree.

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:50.540 line:0%
I feel quite content with my life.

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:55.510 line:0%
It's hot!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:57.880 line:0%
You...

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.800 line:0%
You can't drink hot tea when you're hasty.

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:03.210 line:0%
The same principle applies to solving cases.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:05.330 line:0%
When you're too eager for results,

00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:06.770 line:0%
you'll be misled

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:08.760 line:0%
by what you see

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:10.060 line:0%
on the surface.

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:13.490 line:0%
Misled by what I saw on the surface.

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:16.120 line:0%
Yes, Master.

00:15:16.760 --> 00:15:18.680 line:0%
The evidences I have now

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:20.080 line:0%
seem to have been

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.080 line:0%
left there

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:22.120 line:0%
deliberately.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.680 line:0%
Investigating a case

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.800 line:0%
is not just about uncovering the truth.

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:30.110 line:0%
[Jingshen Pavilion]

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:27.960 line:0%
It's like a contest between you

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:30.200 line:0%
and your unknown enemies.

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:32.960 line:0%
It is to see who will

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:34.690 line:0%
control the situation faster.

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:36.780 line:0%
If back then,

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:39.160 line:0%
the Jinxiu Workshop case

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:41.360 line:0%
was to weaken Princess Runing's power,

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:43.320 line:0%
damaging the relationship between Grand Empress Dowager and the Princess

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:43.920 line:0%
as well as the noble Xiao family

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:45.520 line:0%
behind the Princess,

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:46.640 line:0%
then this time,

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:49.040 line:0%
what's the purpose of those behind the scenes?

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:50.170 line:0%
It's still unclear.

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:51.960 line:0%
Don't rush.

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:54.190 line:0%
Solving cases is like tasting tea.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:57.550 line:0%
It takes time and effort.

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.970 line:0%
Sounds like everything is like tasting tea.

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:03.300 line:0%
[Jingshen Pavilion]

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.080 line:0%
That's right.

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:06.020 line:0%
Marriage is also the same.

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:07.520 line:0%
Master.

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:08.600 line:0%
I'm talking about the case.

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:10.660 line:0%
I'm not talking about anything else.

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:14.000 line:0%
When drinking wine, heroes talk about everything.

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:16.760 line:0%
When enjoying tea, people can talk about love.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.360 line:0%
The tea

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:23.320 line:0%
gets more flavorful with each sip.

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:25.720 line:0%
People are the same.

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:27.780 line:0%
Time reveals a person's true nature.

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:32.940 line:0%
Good tea.

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:34.640 line:0%
Good tea indeed.

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:46.770 line:0%
[Wise and Insightful]

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:52.610 line:0%
[Wise and Insightful]

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:58.450 line:0%
Xing, wait.

00:16:59.050 --> 00:16:59.850 line:0%
Come with me.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:05.760 line:0%
Didn't I tell you

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:07.520 line:0%
to rest in the mansion?

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:09.909 line:0%
The bad old guy Wu Taiming

00:17:09.909 --> 00:17:11.560 line:0%
is worried you might be unlucky and bring bad luck here.

00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:13.090 line:0%
So he doesn't want you here.

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:15.050 line:0%
It's all because of me.

00:17:15.869 --> 00:17:17.399 line:0%
Was Ji Fangming implicated

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:18.510 line:0%
and scolded?

00:17:19.869 --> 00:17:21.560 line:0%
He was the one who guarded the History Archive.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.080 line:0%
The archive was almost burned down.

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:23.800 line:0%
Wu Taiming

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:25.600 line:0%
didn't dare to be angry with you.

00:17:25.629 --> 00:17:26.440 line:0%
So Ji Fangming

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:28.200 line:0%
got scolded a lot.

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:30.880 line:0%
I should think about

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.600 line:0%
how to apologize to him.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:35.390 line:0%
By the way,

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:37.000 line:0%
I heard that

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:39.040 line:0%
you were carried out

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.990 line:0%
by Grand Commander Shen in front of everyone.

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:44.800 line:0%
So what?

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:48.280 line:0%
He couldn't have just stood by and watched me die.

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:49.440 line:0%
You

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:51.040 line:0%
are like a cooked duck.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.700 line:0%
So stubborn.

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:54.520 line:0%
You

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:56.400 line:0%
just blurt out everything.

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:57.720 line:0%
You have no filter.

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:00.400 line:0%
Look at yourself.

00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:02.080 line:0%
You've only been back at the mansion for one day,

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:04.980 line:0%
and now you look radiant.

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:06.680 line:0%
Let me see.

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:09.360 line:0%
What magic does Shen's Mansion

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:10.440 line:0%
have?

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.920 line:0%
It makes your eyes so bright and lively.

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:15.080 line:0%
But...

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:17.790 line:0%
You know what,

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.800 line:0%
when I went back last night,

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:21.390 line:0%
I fell asleep as soon as I lay down.

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:22.270 line:0%
Could it be that

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:24.800 line:0%
I've gotten used to sleeping with lights on

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:28.670 line:0%
because I've adapted to the Shen mansion's all-night illumination?

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:30.190 line:0%
On the contrary, here,

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:31.910 line:0%
I couldn't sleep.

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:33.040 line:0%
Alright.

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:34.530 line:0%
I'm serious.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.420 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:43.860 line:0%
What are these?

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:45.560 line:0%
You saved my life.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:46.840 line:0%
To repay you,

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:47.920 line:0%
I've specially prepared

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:48.480 line:0%
some dishes that will help

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.690 line:0%
with the recovery of your eyes.

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:53.110 line:0%
From today on,

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:54.880 line:0%
the nourishing meals for you

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:55.800 line:0%
will always be offered by me

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:56.400 line:0%
until your eyes

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:58.040 line:0%
are fully healed.

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:03.010 line:0%
Why don't you start eating?

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:05.900 line:0%
Do you

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:07.830 line:0%
not like the food?

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.240 line:0%
Or you don't feel like eating?

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:13.680 line:0%
These dishes

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:15.000 line:0%
were made with sincerity by me.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.640 line:0%
Don't waste them.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:18.010 line:0%
I'll take my leave now.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:26.790 line:0%
♫With a gaze, I know our destiny♫

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:30.670 line:0%
♫When we meet again, I know you're my Mr. Right♫

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:34.700 line:0%
♫The stars remind me of our past♫

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:38.040 line:0%
♫Our love started to grow long ago♫

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:36.940 line:0%
What's the hurry?

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:41.970 line:0%
♫Don't ask about the thoughts of the lover by the candlelight♫

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:45.540 line:0%
♫Our love will last forever♫

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:44.320 line:0%
Since when

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:46.150 line:0%
have you developed this new bad habit?

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:49.450 line:0%
♫With the gentle night breeze, I tell you how much I love you♫

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:50.450 line:0%
Why do you need someone to keep you company while eating now?

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:53.400 line:0%
♫Now I have someone to cherish in my life♫

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:52.760 line:0%
Didn't you make these for me?

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:54.720 line:0%
When I watch you,

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:57.380 line:0%
♫I love you so much and you're my true love♫

00:19:55.240 --> 00:19:56.770 line:0%
the food taste even better.

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:01.080 line:0%
♫With the moon in autumn and the breeze in spring, you're my only true love♫

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:05.120 line:0%
♫Your palms and your eyes♫

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:06.440 line:0%
I told you

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:08.710 line:0%
♫Our love is getting stronger and stronger♫

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.920 line:0%
not to be in a hurry.

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:12.700 line:0%
♫I love you so much and you're my true love♫

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:11.080 line:0%
You're a grown man now.

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:12.000 line:0%
Don't tell me

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:14.160 line:0%
you need someone to feed you.

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:16.410 line:0%
♫With the moon in autumn and the breeze in spring, you're my only true love♫

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:20.240 line:0%
♫Your palms and your eyes♫

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:24.210 line:0%
♫Our love is getting stronger and stronger♫

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:27.360 line:0%
♫You're my only true love♫

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.580 line:0%
This meal is truly made with love.

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:36.040 line:0%
Honey.

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:37.720 line:0%
Let's start eating.

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:54.320 line:0%
From now on,

00:20:54.340 --> 00:20:56.540 line:0%
remember to dine with me for every meal.

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:00.400 line:0%
Will you agree or not?

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:01.910 line:0%
I'm living in your house.

00:21:01.910 --> 00:21:03.430 line:0%
Do I have a choice?

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:09.130 line:0%
Good that you know this.

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:21.080 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:22.620 line:0%
You're eating so messily.

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:24.080 line:0%
I am not.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:27.860 line:0%
I'm not.

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:29.570 line:0%
What's this about?

00:21:30.570 --> 00:21:33.480 line:0%
They're in perfect harmony.

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:35.830 line:0%
What a lovely loving couple.

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:39.340 line:0%
They're so attached to each other.

00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:40.870 line:0%
They really are.

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:44.290 line:0%
But I don't know

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:46.860 line:0%
how long this will last.

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.680 line:0%
Go to the one who really harmed you.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:57.880 line:0%
Don't come to me.

00:21:57.900 --> 00:21:58.830 line:0%
Don't come to me.

00:21:58.850 --> 00:21:59.780 line:0%
Don't come to me.

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:00.980 line:0%
It wasn't me, it wasn't me.

00:22:00.980 --> 00:22:02.840 line:0%
Don't come to me, don't come to me.

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:12.550 line:0%
It wasn't me, it wasn't me.

00:22:12.580 --> 00:22:14.770 line:0%
Don't come to me. Don't come to me.

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:17.690 line:0%
Don't come to me.

00:22:28.340 --> 00:22:30.190 line:0%
[Bright and Virtuous]

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:47.680 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:48.600 line:0%
When we arrived,

00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:50.280 line:0%
the person was already tied to the eaves.

00:22:50.280 --> 00:22:51.720 line:0%
I didn't dare to change anything of the scene

00:22:51.720 --> 00:22:54.050 line:0%
so I waited for you to take further action.

00:22:57.880 --> 00:22:58.700 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:22:58.700 --> 00:22:59.930 line:0%
Chen Shoujie is not dead yet.

00:22:59.930 --> 00:23:01.240 line:0%
Fortunately, the people sent to watch him

00:23:01.240 --> 00:23:02.180 line:0%
rescued him in time.

00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:02.860 line:0%
However,

00:23:02.890 --> 00:23:04.590 line:0%
he seems to have suffered quite a shock.

00:23:04.590 --> 00:23:06.360 line:0%
He was already mentally unstable,

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:06.840 line:0%
and now

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:07.560 line:0%
he can't even say

00:23:07.560 --> 00:23:09.220 line:0%
a complete sentence anymore.

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:10.880 line:0%
The scene here is like

00:23:10.880 --> 00:23:12.600 line:0%
what happened at the Furong Garden back then.

00:23:12.600 --> 00:23:14.160 line:0%
At that time, Han Shiyuan and Sister Caiwei

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:15.960 line:0%
were also tied up and hung high.

00:23:16.340 --> 00:23:18.270 line:0%
There was burning charcoal below.

00:23:18.400 --> 00:23:19.490 line:0%
But back then, what was burning

00:23:19.490 --> 00:23:21.380 line:0%
was the Cold Flame used in the Western Regions' acrobatics.

00:23:21.380 --> 00:23:22.470 line:0%
Looks like

00:23:22.760 --> 00:23:24.420 line:0%
they really meant to kill him.

00:23:25.990 --> 00:23:27.320 line:0%
Who on earth

00:23:28.200 --> 00:23:29.880 line:0%
intended to kill Chen Shoujie

00:23:30.250 --> 00:23:32.090 line:0%
in such a cruel way?

00:23:34.920 --> 00:23:35.720 line:0%
Let's go.

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:47.240 line:0%
How come Chen's mansion was burned down like this?

00:23:47.240 --> 00:23:48.460 line:0%
It's terrible.

00:23:50.430 --> 00:23:51.490 line:0%
Who's there?

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:53.040 line:0%
Why are you hiding?

00:23:53.360 --> 00:23:54.160 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:23:55.620 --> 00:23:57.210 line:0%
What's going on here?

00:23:57.480 --> 00:23:59.180 line:0%
What's happening?

00:24:00.240 --> 00:24:01.820 line:0%
They've caught someone.

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:05.420 line:0%
It's you.

00:24:06.400 --> 00:24:07.200 line:0%
He

00:24:07.240 --> 00:24:07.720 line:0%
is from the Ministry of Justice.

00:24:07.720 --> 00:24:10.580 line:0%
He's Ji Fangming, who guarded the History Archive.

00:24:15.850 --> 00:24:17.290 line:0%
Regarding the fire at the History Archive,

00:24:17.290 --> 00:24:19.750 line:0%
we still need your statement and signature.

00:24:20.120 --> 00:24:21.680 line:0%
On my way to Shen's Mansion,

00:24:21.760 --> 00:24:22.800 line:0%
I saw you

00:24:22.980 --> 00:24:24.560 line:0%
hurrying here.

00:24:30.920 --> 00:24:31.680 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:24:31.680 --> 00:24:32.840 line:0%
Someone was burned to death in the east of the city.

00:24:32.840 --> 00:24:33.560 line:0%
What?

00:24:34.020 --> 00:24:35.080 line:0%
Burned to death?

00:24:35.080 --> 00:24:35.800 line:0%
Who was it?

00:24:35.820 --> 00:24:37.200 line:0%
It was a guard from our Imperial Security Bureau,

00:24:37.200 --> 00:24:37.960 line:0%
Captain Sun.

00:24:39.450 --> 00:24:40.580 line:0%
It's him.

00:24:44.090 --> 00:24:45.640 line:0%
Do you know about the Fire Moth Sect?

00:24:45.640 --> 00:24:46.240 line:0%
The Fire Moth Sect?

00:24:46.240 --> 00:24:47.440 line:0%
It was Chen Huo'e

00:24:47.470 --> 00:24:48.970 line:0%
who punished him in person.

00:24:48.970 --> 00:24:49.480 line:0%
You know what?

00:24:49.480 --> 00:24:50.720 line:0%
The other day, at the Ministry of Justice,

00:24:50.720 --> 00:24:52.480 line:0%
a sudden big fire broke out.

00:24:52.500 --> 00:24:53.780 line:0%
The fire was to

00:24:53.810 --> 00:24:56.010 line:0%
punish the Madam of Shen's Mansion.

00:24:56.030 --> 00:24:57.120 line:0%
The Madam of Shen's Mansion?

00:24:57.120 --> 00:24:58.650 line:0%
She almost burned to death.

00:24:58.660 --> 00:24:59.530 line:0%
Maybe it's because

00:24:59.530 --> 00:25:01.470 line:0%
White Ghost has done countless evil deeds

00:25:01.470 --> 00:25:04.000 line:0%
and the retribution has fallen upon his wife.

00:25:18.920 --> 00:25:21.000 line:0%
The sound of wind and rain came in the night.

00:25:21.000 --> 00:25:22.800 line:0%
I kept sitting still like a bell.

00:25:23.650 --> 00:25:25.080 line:0%
Stuffed from a late-night snack,

00:25:25.080 --> 00:25:26.740 line:0%
I still need a few more drinks.

00:25:29.800 --> 00:25:31.280 line:0%
Have you traced the origin

00:25:31.280 --> 00:25:32.720 line:0%
of the powder I asked you to investigate?

00:25:32.720 --> 00:25:34.420 line:0%
It is from the Western Regions.

00:25:34.420 --> 00:25:35.750 line:0%
It's quite mysterious.

00:25:35.960 --> 00:25:36.760 line:0%
It took me

00:25:36.800 --> 00:25:38.120 line:0%
quite some time and effort

00:25:38.120 --> 00:25:39.180 line:0%
to investigate it.

00:25:39.400 --> 00:25:41.160 line:0%
Trying to charge me more money?

00:25:41.520 --> 00:25:42.360 line:0%
No way.

00:25:43.050 --> 00:25:44.930 line:0%
Don't you know the code words?

00:25:45.050 --> 00:25:46.380 line:0%
How could you come and bring nothing for me?

00:25:46.380 --> 00:25:47.480 line:0%
At the very least,

00:25:47.560 --> 00:25:48.400 line:0%
you should bring a couple of jugs of wine

00:25:48.400 --> 00:25:49.640 line:0%
to reward me.

00:25:50.070 --> 00:25:51.320 line:0%
If you admit

00:25:51.320 --> 00:25:52.800 line:0%
that you are the famous

00:25:52.800 --> 00:25:54.320 line:0%
folk detective Pan Chi,

00:25:54.480 --> 00:25:55.800 line:0%
I might consider

00:25:55.800 --> 00:25:56.960 line:0%
treating you to the best

00:25:56.960 --> 00:25:58.680 line:0%
osmanthus wine in the Xiang'an City.

00:25:58.680 --> 00:25:59.600 line:0%
I am!

00:26:04.100 --> 00:26:05.500 line:0%
If I really were,

00:26:05.530 --> 00:26:06.400 line:0%
will you

00:26:06.480 --> 00:26:07.240 line:0%
pay me

00:26:07.240 --> 00:26:08.040 line:0%
more money?

00:26:08.040 --> 00:26:08.960 line:0%
Dream on.

00:26:10.090 --> 00:26:11.680 line:0%
Thinking about it makes me feel nice.

00:26:11.680 --> 00:26:12.920 line:0%
You should go back too.

00:26:12.920 --> 00:26:15.720 line:0%
The Ghost Market hasn't been peaceful these days.

00:26:23.760 --> 00:26:24.600 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:26:24.600 --> 00:26:25.360 line:0%
I've got new information of Ji Fangming from the Ministry of Justice,

00:26:25.360 --> 00:26:26.520 line:0%
the person you asked me to investigate.

00:26:26.520 --> 00:26:27.320 line:0%
I got a prescription

00:26:27.320 --> 00:26:27.960 line:0%
written by him

00:26:27.960 --> 00:26:29.040 line:0%
for himself.

00:26:33.000 --> 00:26:34.060 line:0%
He's with disease?

00:26:34.840 --> 00:26:35.720 line:0%
I didn't expect him

00:26:35.720 --> 00:26:37.140 line:0%
to know about pharmacology.

00:26:37.140 --> 00:26:38.300 line:0%
After following him for a few days,

00:26:38.300 --> 00:26:39.200 line:0%
I found that his health

00:26:39.200 --> 00:26:40.320 line:0%
was indeed not very good.

00:26:40.320 --> 00:26:41.360 line:0%
It seems to be a chronic illness.

00:26:41.100 --> 00:26:43.090 line:0%
[Two taels of Danshen, two taels of Baizhi, four taels of sandalwood, two taels of Peilan]

00:26:41.640 --> 00:26:43.480 line:0%
Give this prescription to the pharmacy.

00:26:43.480 --> 00:26:44.640 line:0%
I want to see

00:26:44.840 --> 00:26:46.600 line:0%
what illness he's actually suffering from.

00:26:46.600 --> 00:26:47.760 line:0%
You suspect him?

00:26:47.780 --> 00:26:49.730 line:0%
The fire at the History Archive of the Ministry of Justice

00:26:49.730 --> 00:26:51.940 line:0%
was set at too convenient a time.

00:27:05.930 --> 00:27:07.360 line:0%
Grand Commander must be busy.

00:27:07.360 --> 00:27:08.440 line:0%
I just came to ask

00:27:08.440 --> 00:27:09.760 line:0%
what kind of tea he would like.

00:27:09.760 --> 00:27:10.880 line:0%
Don't bother.

00:27:10.960 --> 00:27:12.640 line:0%
Miss Yun Que, please go back.

00:27:13.680 --> 00:27:14.880 line:0%
Is there any progress

00:27:14.880 --> 00:27:16.480 line:0%
on the Jinxiu Workshop case?

00:27:16.720 --> 00:27:17.680 line:0%
Don't worry, Miss.

00:27:17.680 --> 00:27:18.480 line:0%
When necessary,

00:27:18.480 --> 00:27:20.740 line:0%
Grand Commander will surely inform you.

00:27:26.330 --> 00:27:27.590 line:0%
I've found something.

00:27:29.880 --> 00:27:31.000 line:0%
The powder

00:27:31.040 --> 00:27:32.520 line:0%
was made from a plant unique to the Western Regions,

00:27:32.520 --> 00:27:33.680 line:0%
It was made by grinding the plant.

00:27:33.680 --> 00:27:34.360 line:0%
When burned,

00:27:34.360 --> 00:27:36.280 line:0%
it produces a special odor

00:27:36.310 --> 00:27:37.640 line:0%
that can make those who smell it

00:27:37.640 --> 00:27:39.120 line:0%
feel extremely excited,

00:27:39.160 --> 00:27:40.680 line:0%
or even hallucinate.

00:27:40.680 --> 00:27:41.480 line:0%
It's said that

00:27:41.640 --> 00:27:42.920 line:0%
if someone misleads

00:27:42.920 --> 00:27:44.280 line:0%
those who smell it in secret,

00:27:44.280 --> 00:27:45.600 line:0%
they will

00:27:45.600 --> 00:27:46.960 line:0%
have the same

00:27:46.960 --> 00:27:48.120 line:0%
hallucinations.

00:27:49.480 --> 00:27:50.120 line:0%
In the Ghost Market,

00:27:50.120 --> 00:27:51.850 line:0%
is someone selling the powder?

00:27:52.500 --> 00:27:53.970 line:0%
Actually, no.

00:27:54.520 --> 00:27:55.960 line:0%
It's said that although this plant

00:27:55.960 --> 00:27:58.050 line:0%
is common in the Western Regions,

00:27:58.160 --> 00:27:59.040 line:0%
once it is taken out

00:27:59.040 --> 00:27:59.840 line:0%
of the specific soil,

00:27:59.840 --> 00:28:01.120 line:0%
it's hard for it to survive.

00:28:01.120 --> 00:28:02.360 line:0%
So this powder

00:28:02.360 --> 00:28:03.160 line:0%
cannot be stored

00:28:03.160 --> 00:28:04.640 line:0%
for too long

00:28:04.640 --> 00:28:05.400 line:0%
if they are to have

00:28:05.400 --> 00:28:06.680 line:0%
a strong hallucinogenic effect.

00:28:06.680 --> 00:28:07.600 line:0%
Could it be that

00:28:07.720 --> 00:28:08.840 line:0%
someone has secretly cultivated

00:28:08.840 --> 00:28:10.300 line:0%
this plant in the capital?

00:28:13.320 --> 00:28:15.050 line:0%
Is your information reliable?

00:28:15.180 --> 00:28:17.280 line:0%
I got it from my friend Pan Chi

00:28:17.280 --> 00:28:18.290 line:0%
in the Ghost Market.

00:28:18.290 --> 00:28:20.550 line:0%
The information from him is never wrong.

00:28:23.390 --> 00:28:25.390 line:0%
Do you know that Ji Fangming is sick?

00:28:29.500 --> 00:28:32.300 line:0%
You only rely on your friend from the Ghost Market,

00:28:32.370 --> 00:28:34.630 line:0%
ignoring the clues right in front of you.

00:28:52.700 --> 00:28:54.880 line:0%
That time at Chen Shoujie's mansion,

00:28:54.900 --> 00:28:56.610 line:0%
his reaction and the timing of his arrival

00:28:56.610 --> 00:28:57.940 line:0%
were both very strange.

00:29:03.880 --> 00:29:04.880 line:0%
Others were interested in

00:29:04.880 --> 00:29:06.810 line:0%
what had happened inside the room,

00:29:07.140 --> 00:29:08.600 line:0%
but he was curious about

00:29:08.600 --> 00:29:10.730 line:0%
our reactions to seeing these things.

00:29:11.470 --> 00:29:12.270 line:0%
That's right.

00:29:20.360 --> 00:29:21.790 line:0%
I also remember

00:29:22.190 --> 00:29:24.360 line:0%
I once smelled a faint scent

00:29:24.380 --> 00:29:26.140 line:0%
on Ji Fangming.

00:29:27.700 --> 00:29:29.760 line:0%
I didn't pay much attention to it at the time,

00:29:29.760 --> 00:29:30.800 line:0%
but now I feel

00:29:30.820 --> 00:29:32.240 line:0%
that scent is somewhat familiar,

00:29:32.240 --> 00:29:33.400 line:0%
but not common.

00:29:35.970 --> 00:29:38.230 line:0%
I've only smelled it in one place before.

00:29:38.950 --> 00:29:40.350 line:0%
At the Mingsheng Temple.

00:29:41.410 --> 00:29:43.340 line:0%
He's been to the Mingsheng Temple?

00:29:44.250 --> 00:29:45.180 line:0%
I asked Chuichui

00:29:45.200 --> 00:29:47.060 line:0%
to investigate Ji Fangming's background.

00:29:47.060 --> 00:29:48.120 line:0%
While at it, I also inquired

00:29:48.120 --> 00:29:49.880 line:0%
about his personal information.

00:29:49.880 --> 00:29:51.210 line:0%
His entry into the Ministry of Justice

00:29:51.210 --> 00:29:52.920 line:0%
was through someone's recommendation.

00:29:52.920 --> 00:29:54.450 line:0%
Guess who recommended him?

00:29:57.550 --> 00:29:58.600 line:0%
Could it be...

00:29:58.620 --> 00:29:59.420 line:0%
That's right.

00:29:59.820 --> 00:30:00.980 line:0%
It was Chen Shoujie.

00:30:02.420 --> 00:30:03.820 line:0%
Apart from this,

00:30:04.330 --> 00:30:06.290 line:0%
there's nothing special about his past.

00:30:06.290 --> 00:30:08.130 line:0%
Nothing suspicious was found.

00:30:09.640 --> 00:30:12.080 line:0%
The more ordinary it looks, the more suspicious it is.

00:30:12.080 --> 00:30:14.410 line:0%
There must be some hidden truth behind it.

00:30:15.160 --> 00:30:16.680 line:0%
Chen Shoujie in the past

00:30:16.700 --> 00:30:18.380 line:0%
once kindly recommended him.

00:30:19.280 --> 00:30:21.180 line:0%
But that day at the crime scene,

00:30:21.240 --> 00:30:23.280 line:0%
he pretended not to know him.

00:30:24.580 --> 00:30:26.600 line:0%
Chen Shoujie recommended him?

00:30:29.720 --> 00:30:31.480 line:0%
I've investigated both of them.

00:30:31.480 --> 00:30:33.670 line:0%
They seem to have had no connection at all.

00:30:33.670 --> 00:30:34.920 line:0%
That means

00:30:36.040 --> 00:30:37.720 line:0%
apart from them two,

00:30:37.920 --> 00:30:40.180 line:0%
there must be someone we haven't discovered

00:30:40.180 --> 00:30:41.040 line:0%
who is linked to

00:30:41.040 --> 00:30:42.480 line:0%
both of them.

00:30:44.010 --> 00:30:44.950 line:0%
It seems

00:30:46.960 --> 00:30:49.220 line:0%
we'll have to question them personally.

00:31:01.480 --> 00:31:02.280 line:0%
Mr. Ji.

00:31:02.840 --> 00:31:03.320 line:0%
Here.

00:31:04.200 --> 00:31:05.080 line:0%
Miss Yan.

00:31:05.560 --> 00:31:06.360 line:0%
These are?

00:31:08.400 --> 00:31:10.040 line:0%
Finally, we don't have to look at those

00:31:10.040 --> 00:31:11.700 line:0%
incomplete records anymore.

00:31:12.160 --> 00:31:12.960 line:0%
You mean

00:31:13.720 --> 00:31:15.180 line:0%
you've found the culprit?

00:31:15.520 --> 00:31:16.760 line:0%
Yes, we have.

00:31:16.960 --> 00:31:18.040 line:0%
All these crimes

00:31:18.520 --> 00:31:20.300 line:0%
were committed by Chen Shoujie.

00:31:20.300 --> 00:31:21.600 line:0%
He was pretending to be a lunatic

00:31:21.600 --> 00:31:22.520 line:0%
deceiving everyone.

00:31:22.520 --> 00:31:23.280 line:0%
In fact,

00:31:23.300 --> 00:31:25.320 line:0%
he was just talking to himself all along.

00:31:25.320 --> 00:31:26.120 line:0%
What?

00:31:26.400 --> 00:31:27.260 line:0%
He pleaded guilty?

00:31:27.260 --> 00:31:28.180 line:0%
Yes.

00:31:28.620 --> 00:31:30.590 line:0%
You know how good my husband is.

00:31:30.690 --> 00:31:33.320 line:0%
He's the well-known White Ghost.

00:31:33.680 --> 00:31:34.660 line:0%
In less than a day,

00:31:34.660 --> 00:31:36.860 line:0%
Chen Shoujie confessed to everything.

00:31:38.010 --> 00:31:40.060 line:0%
He was just pretending to be crazy.

00:31:45.830 --> 00:31:47.360 line:0%
How could this be possible?

00:31:47.900 --> 00:31:49.500 line:0%
Why wouldn't it be possible?

00:31:49.660 --> 00:31:50.820 line:0%
It was him.

00:31:51.180 --> 00:31:52.480 line:0%
He deliberately concealed

00:31:52.480 --> 00:31:54.680 line:0%
the key evidences of the Jinxiu Workshop case.

00:31:54.680 --> 00:31:56.120 line:0%
So many people died unjustly because of him.

00:31:56.120 --> 00:31:57.400 line:0%
He was bribed

00:31:57.440 --> 00:31:58.640 line:0%
with a thousand taels of gold,

00:31:58.640 --> 00:32:00.440 line:0%
which he buried in his own courtyard.

00:32:00.440 --> 00:32:01.080 line:0%
It took

00:32:01.080 --> 00:32:02.240 line:0%
several hours of digging

00:32:02.240 --> 00:32:03.160 line:0%
to unearth it.

00:32:05.380 --> 00:32:06.440 line:0%
I can't believe it.

00:32:07.610 --> 00:32:08.870 line:0%
I really can't believe

00:32:12.520 --> 00:32:14.240 line:0%
he hid everything so well.

00:32:16.880 --> 00:32:17.680 line:0%
Yes.

00:32:17.920 --> 00:32:19.960 line:0%
If my husband hadn't figure out everything,

00:32:19.960 --> 00:32:21.880 line:0%
we would still be deceived.

00:32:21.900 --> 00:32:22.880 line:0%
Is he now

00:32:22.880 --> 00:32:25.080 line:0%
detained in Imperial Security Bureau?

00:32:25.680 --> 00:32:27.440 line:0%
He's in the prison of the Ministry of Justice.

00:32:27.440 --> 00:32:28.500 line:0%
Tomorrow,

00:32:28.720 --> 00:32:30.280 line:0%
he'll be executed in secret.

00:32:30.280 --> 00:32:31.480 line:0%
Be executed in secret?

00:32:31.480 --> 00:32:32.280 line:0%
Why?

00:32:35.440 --> 00:32:37.300 line:0%
It's the decision from the above.

00:32:39.540 --> 00:32:41.210 line:0%
Perhaps,

00:32:41.530 --> 00:32:43.080 line:0%
there might be some hidden truths

00:32:43.080 --> 00:32:44.700 line:0%
behind this case.

00:32:46.710 --> 00:32:48.650 line:0%
If Princess Runing

00:32:48.750 --> 00:32:49.650 line:0%
was confined in Mingsheng Temple

00:32:49.650 --> 00:32:51.560 line:0%
because she was deliberately wronged,

00:32:51.560 --> 00:32:53.120 line:0%
then the Jinxiu Workshop case

00:32:53.120 --> 00:32:54.640 line:0%
might just be

00:32:54.640 --> 00:32:55.360 line:0%
made

00:32:55.360 --> 00:32:56.880 line:0%
to scheme against the royal princess.

00:32:56.880 --> 00:32:57.600 line:0%
What?

00:32:58.160 --> 00:32:59.080 line:0%
Are you saying

00:32:59.110 --> 00:33:00.650 line:0%
the dozen or so lives lost in the Jinxiu Workshop

00:33:00.650 --> 00:33:01.860 line:0%
were just for...

00:33:04.400 --> 00:33:06.060 line:0%
We can't speak of such things.

00:33:06.180 --> 00:33:07.170 line:0%
Therefore,

00:33:07.400 --> 00:33:09.660 line:0%
the investigation can't go any further.

00:33:32.200 --> 00:33:33.480 line:0%
It was all my fault.

00:33:35.420 --> 00:33:37.180 line:0%
It was all my fault.

00:33:38.520 --> 00:33:40.290 line:0%
It was all my fault.

00:33:44.120 --> 00:33:45.740 line:0%
Who ordered you to do it?

00:33:45.920 --> 00:33:48.440 line:0%
More a dozen lives at the Jinxiu Workshop were lost because of you!

00:33:48.440 --> 00:33:49.420 line:0%
Still pretending?

00:33:49.420 --> 00:33:51.060 line:0%
I'll kill you today.

00:34:02.320 --> 00:34:03.320 line:0%
It's fake.

00:34:04.170 --> 00:34:05.760 line:0%
Those who offend the Fire Moth Sect

00:34:05.760 --> 00:34:08.019 line:0%
will suffer the Fire Moth's punishment.

00:34:34.620 --> 00:34:35.590 line:0%
Ji Fangming.

00:34:35.620 --> 00:34:36.550 line:0%
It's really you.

00:34:40.920 --> 00:34:42.920 line:0%
You deliberately said those things

00:34:43.060 --> 00:34:45.019 line:0%
to lure me here.

00:34:45.539 --> 00:34:46.560 line:0%
You had many chances

00:34:46.560 --> 00:34:48.100 line:0%
to kill Chen Shoujie,

00:34:48.130 --> 00:34:49.180 line:0%
but you didn't.

00:34:49.430 --> 00:34:50.680 line:0%
We were speculating

00:34:50.740 --> 00:34:52.289 line:0%
that perhaps what the killer wanted

00:34:52.289 --> 00:34:53.950 line:0%
was not Chen Shoujie's death,

00:34:53.950 --> 00:34:55.110 line:0%
but to torture him.

00:34:55.880 --> 00:34:57.440 line:0%
No one wanted more than the killer

00:34:57.440 --> 00:34:58.690 line:0%
for him to be conscious.

00:34:58.690 --> 00:34:59.890 line:0%
That way, the torture

00:35:00.040 --> 00:35:01.500 line:0%
would be more satisfying.

00:35:03.770 --> 00:35:04.800 line:0%
Ji Fangming.

00:35:04.980 --> 00:35:06.570 line:0%
Now you're caught red-handed.

00:35:06.570 --> 00:35:07.830 line:0%
Do you have anything to say?

00:35:07.830 --> 00:35:09.160 line:0%
I am not the murderer.

00:35:09.630 --> 00:35:10.560 line:0%
I don't even know

00:35:10.560 --> 00:35:12.080 line:0%
why I'm here.

00:35:12.330 --> 00:35:14.830 line:0%
Perhaps I was bewitched by some bad guy

00:35:14.980 --> 00:35:17.040 line:0%
and came here in a state of confusion.

00:35:17.380 --> 00:35:19.060 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, Mrs. Shen.

00:35:19.060 --> 00:35:19.840 line:0%
You've encountered

00:35:19.840 --> 00:35:21.000 line:0%
such situations before.

00:35:21.000 --> 00:35:23.260 line:0%
You should be able to understand, right?

00:35:23.480 --> 00:35:24.360 line:0%
I have absolutely no

00:35:24.360 --> 00:35:26.480 line:0%
reason to kill Chen Shoujie.

00:35:27.610 --> 00:35:29.520 line:0%
You did everything for the owner of the Jinxiu Workshop

00:35:29.520 --> 00:35:30.780 line:0%
Kong Xianrong, right?

00:35:38.500 --> 00:35:39.940 line:0%
It's been so many years.

00:35:40.730 --> 00:35:42.160 line:0%
Few dare to mention

00:35:42.160 --> 00:35:44.240 line:0%
the criminal of the Jinxiu Workshop treason case.

00:35:44.240 --> 00:35:45.170 line:0%
I never expected

00:35:47.390 --> 00:35:49.850 line:0%
that someone would still remember his name.

00:35:51.520 --> 00:35:52.440 line:0%
You set fire

00:35:52.440 --> 00:35:54.040 line:0%
to the Ministry of Justice's History Archive

00:35:54.040 --> 00:35:55.700 line:0%
It wasn't just to harm me.

00:35:55.720 --> 00:35:56.640 line:0%
What you wanted

00:35:56.670 --> 00:35:58.530 line:0%
was to destroy the documents there.

00:35:58.530 --> 00:36:00.320 line:0%
You wanted to erase all the evidences

00:36:00.320 --> 00:36:01.460 line:0%
of your connection with Chen Shoujie

00:36:01.460 --> 00:36:03.610 line:0%
and Kong Xianrong, the owner of the Jinxiu Workshop.

00:36:03.610 --> 00:36:04.250 line:0%
The three of you

00:36:04.250 --> 00:36:05.680 line:0%
had known each other for a long time.

00:36:05.680 --> 00:36:06.960 line:0%
Is this all you have,

00:36:07.800 --> 00:36:08.760 line:0%
Miss Yan?

00:36:08.980 --> 00:36:11.000 line:0%
Is it enough to convict me?

00:36:11.120 --> 00:36:12.520 line:0%
So you're admitting it?

00:36:17.120 --> 00:36:19.700 line:0%
I got to know Xianrong long ago.

00:36:20.880 --> 00:36:23.040 line:0%
The two of us had a lot in common.

00:36:23.850 --> 00:36:26.270 line:0%
We met while taking shelter from the rain in a teahouse.

00:36:26.270 --> 00:36:27.220 line:0%
[Kong Xianrong]

00:36:26.680 --> 00:36:28.120 line:0%
Xian Rong was eloquent and articulate.

00:36:28.120 --> 00:36:29.320 line:0%
He was very talented.

00:36:29.640 --> 00:36:30.920 line:0%
We hit it off immediately.

00:36:30.920 --> 00:36:32.040 line:0%
Our conversations were delightful.

00:36:31.020 --> 00:36:32.090 line:0%
[First-Place Scholar] [Second-Place Scholar]

00:36:33.120 --> 00:36:34.980 line:0%
We quickly became close friends.

00:36:37.010 --> 00:36:38.730 line:0%
After I failed the imperial examination,

00:36:38.730 --> 00:36:40.690 line:0%
[Jinxiu Workshop]

00:36:39.370 --> 00:36:40.200 line:0%
he introduced me

00:36:40.200 --> 00:36:41.800 line:0%
to Chen Shoujie

00:36:42.420 --> 00:36:44.620 line:0%
so that I got to work for the government.

00:36:45.520 --> 00:36:46.510 line:0%
However,

00:36:46.760 --> 00:36:48.460 line:0%
something unexpected happened.

00:36:48.460 --> 00:36:50.030 line:0%
The people of the Jinxiu Workshop were wrongly accused.

00:36:50.030 --> 00:36:52.440 line:0%
Kong Xianrong's entire family was executed.

00:36:52.440 --> 00:36:54.260 line:0%
I stood among the crowd,

00:36:54.440 --> 00:36:56.500 line:0%
watching his family die tragically.

00:36:56.530 --> 00:36:58.070 line:0%
Blood flowed like a river.

00:36:58.630 --> 00:36:59.930 line:0%
How do you know

00:37:00.080 --> 00:37:02.320 line:0%
that Kong Xianrong was wrongly accused?

00:37:02.320 --> 00:37:03.360 line:0%
Over these years,

00:37:04.970 --> 00:37:06.850 line:0%
I've read all the county records

00:37:07.240 --> 00:37:09.680 line:0%
and checked all the criminal case files.

00:37:10.250 --> 00:37:12.060 line:0%
Finally,

00:37:12.280 --> 00:37:13.320 line:0%
I found

00:37:13.320 --> 00:37:14.290 line:0%
vital clues.

00:37:14.730 --> 00:37:17.060 line:0%
Kong treated Chen Shoujie like a brother,

00:37:17.650 --> 00:37:18.890 line:0%
but Chen Shoujie,

00:37:19.630 --> 00:37:21.230 line:0%
for his own selfish desires,

00:37:21.280 --> 00:37:22.600 line:0%
betrayed Kong who trusted him so much.

00:37:22.600 --> 00:37:23.360 line:0%
So,

00:37:23.440 --> 00:37:24.800 line:0%
you killed his wife

00:37:24.800 --> 00:37:25.600 line:0%
and tried every means

00:37:25.600 --> 00:37:26.760 line:0%
to torment Chen Shoujie.

00:37:26.760 --> 00:37:27.890 line:0%
She deserved to die!

00:37:28.000 --> 00:37:28.960 line:0%
Chen deserved to die!

00:37:28.960 --> 00:37:30.720 line:0%
Chen Shoujie deserved to die even more.

00:37:30.720 --> 00:37:31.720 line:0%
Did you kill Captain Sun

00:37:31.720 --> 00:37:33.750 line:0%
who worked for the Imperial Security Bureau

00:37:33.750 --> 00:37:34.860 line:0%
in the east of the city?

00:37:34.860 --> 00:37:36.130 line:0%
His life or death

00:37:36.350 --> 00:37:37.560 line:0%
was not my concern.

00:37:37.680 --> 00:37:38.680 line:0%
Then who exactly

00:37:38.680 --> 00:37:41.880 line:0%
taught you to impersonate Chen Huo'e to commit the crime?

00:37:45.430 --> 00:37:47.060 line:0%
Moths to a flame.

00:37:47.280 --> 00:37:49.090 line:0%
Born at dawn, dead by dusk.

00:37:49.220 --> 00:37:50.680 line:0%
Not entering the cycle of reincarnation.

00:37:50.680 --> 00:37:52.700 line:0%
Immortal reincarnation.

00:37:56.360 --> 00:37:57.960 line:0%
Put Ji Fangming in prison.

00:37:58.310 --> 00:37:59.370 line:0%
Await further orders.

00:37:59.370 --> 00:38:00.080 line:0%
I was avenging the people of the Jinxiu Workshop

00:38:00.080 --> 00:38:01.480 line:0%
who were wrongly accused.

00:38:01.480 --> 00:38:02.380 line:0%
I did nothing wrong!

00:38:02.380 --> 00:38:03.620 line:0%
I did nothing wrong!

00:38:03.690 --> 00:38:06.420 line:0%
Chen Shoujie deserved to die, he deserved to die!

00:38:10.070 --> 00:38:12.540 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:38:37.490 --> 00:38:39.740 line:0%
Is the food not good today?

00:38:40.440 --> 00:38:41.990 line:0%
Why aren't you talking?

00:38:42.190 --> 00:38:43.360 line:0%
You were provoking Ji Fangming today.

00:38:43.360 --> 00:38:44.960 line:0%
It was completely reckless.

00:38:45.620 --> 00:38:47.260 line:0%
What if something had gone wrong...

00:38:47.260 --> 00:38:49.220 line:0%
Anyway, I made him confess.

00:38:51.300 --> 00:38:52.570 line:0%
Indeed,

00:38:52.760 --> 00:38:54.880 line:0%
simple methods

00:38:54.960 --> 00:38:56.760 line:0%
sometimes are more effective.

00:38:57.620 --> 00:38:58.500 line:0%
The rest

00:38:58.560 --> 00:38:59.280 line:0%
depends on

00:38:59.280 --> 00:39:01.080 line:0%
how you as the Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:39:01.080 --> 00:39:03.440 line:0%
will conduct the court interrogation.

00:39:04.520 --> 00:39:06.720 line:0%
I'm afraid this case isn't that simple.

00:39:07.330 --> 00:39:09.360 line:0%
Ji Fangming has already been detained.

00:39:09.360 --> 00:39:11.560 line:0%
If evidence is found to convict him,

00:39:11.590 --> 00:39:13.070 line:0%
can we close the case then?

00:39:13.600 --> 00:39:14.560 line:0%
If everything

00:39:14.560 --> 00:39:15.720 line:0%
was done by Ji Fangming,

00:39:15.720 --> 00:39:16.800 line:0%
then closing the case

00:39:16.800 --> 00:39:18.060 line:0%
is the right thing to do.

00:39:18.060 --> 00:39:19.440 line:0%
But there's one thing

00:39:19.870 --> 00:39:21.270 line:0%
that doesn't feel right.

00:39:21.560 --> 00:39:22.960 line:0%
What doesn't feel right?

00:39:23.000 --> 00:39:24.800 line:0%
The Fire Moth Sect's attempt to make a god

00:39:24.800 --> 00:39:25.720 line:0%
is progressing faster

00:39:25.720 --> 00:39:26.950 line:0%
than we imagined.

00:39:27.190 --> 00:39:28.400 line:0%
When Ji Fangming

00:39:28.400 --> 00:39:29.600 line:0%
tried to burn Chen Shoujie to death,

00:39:29.600 --> 00:39:30.480 line:0%
they committed

00:39:30.930 --> 00:39:33.250 line:0%
a crime in the east of the city at the same time.

00:39:33.250 --> 00:39:35.580 line:0%
It can be said they acted without any fear.

00:39:36.200 --> 00:39:37.590 line:0%
The person

00:39:39.330 --> 00:39:40.750 line:0%
behind the Fire Moth Sect

00:39:40.970 --> 00:39:42.050 line:0%
is really

00:39:42.080 --> 00:39:43.720 line:0%
Chen Huo'e was resurrected?

00:40:01.490 --> 00:40:02.640 line:0%
Your cooking skills

00:40:04.970 --> 00:40:07.100 line:0%
have shown no improvement, I must say.

00:40:12.960 --> 00:40:15.160 line:0%
But after I ate food made by you many times,

00:40:15.160 --> 00:40:17.160 line:0%
I don't feel it's not that terrible.

00:40:24.640 --> 00:40:26.560 line:0%
My skills haven't improved,

00:40:26.580 --> 00:40:27.440 line:0%
but you can

00:40:27.440 --> 00:40:28.770 line:0%
have a better appetite.

00:40:38.080 --> 00:40:38.920 line:0%
The person you arrested

00:40:38.920 --> 00:40:42.120 line:0%
was seeking revenge for the people at the Jinxiu Workshop

00:40:44.920 --> 00:40:46.240 line:0%
I risked my life to collect

00:40:46.240 --> 00:40:47.520 line:0%
the evidences for the Jinxiu Workshop case.

00:40:47.520 --> 00:40:48.280 line:0%
If there's an interrogation,

00:40:48.280 --> 00:40:49.680 line:0%
I want to go along as well.

00:40:55.600 --> 00:40:57.440 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice]

00:41:00.200 --> 00:41:01.000 line:0%
Ji Fangming,

00:41:01.440 --> 00:41:02.120 line:0%
you murdered

00:41:02.120 --> 00:41:03.980 line:0%
Chen Shoujie's wife, Madam Chen.

00:41:04.040 --> 00:41:04.840 line:0%
While attempting to assassinate

00:41:04.840 --> 00:41:05.840 line:0%
Chen Shoujie,

00:41:05.840 --> 00:41:07.440 line:0%
you were caught red-handed.

00:41:07.590 --> 00:41:08.920 line:0%
Tell us the whole story,

00:41:09.480 --> 00:41:11.480 line:0%
and who else you collaborated with.

00:41:12.000 --> 00:41:13.280 line:0%
Confess truthfully.

00:41:13.640 --> 00:41:15.840 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, that's quite an intimidating manner.

00:41:15.840 --> 00:41:17.560 line:0%
In all my years at the Ministry of Justice,

00:41:17.560 --> 00:41:19.600 line:0%
I've seen plenty of bluffing.

00:41:19.730 --> 00:41:21.930 line:0%
This tactic won't work on me.

00:41:23.200 --> 00:41:24.200 line:0%
Ji Fangming,

00:41:25.820 --> 00:41:28.130 line:0%
at this point, you'd better come clean.

00:41:28.320 --> 00:41:30.120 line:0%
Don't try these useless tricks.

00:41:32.320 --> 00:41:33.780 line:0%
If you won't confess here,

00:41:34.720 --> 00:41:37.040 line:0%
we'll take you to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:41:37.040 --> 00:41:39.240 line:0%
I have plenty of methods at my disposal.

00:41:41.970 --> 00:41:44.390 line:0%
Grand Commander, are you going to force him

00:41:45.490 --> 00:41:47.090 line:0%
to confess by torturing him?

00:41:49.470 --> 00:41:51.910 line:0%
Lord Lai, you're right on time.

00:41:52.120 --> 00:41:54.930 line:0%
As they say, it's not about being early, but being timely.

00:41:54.930 --> 00:41:56.130 line:0%
If I hadn't come,

00:41:56.260 --> 00:41:57.840 line:0%
how could I see you

00:41:57.840 --> 00:41:59.680 line:0%
being so intimidating?

00:42:00.760 --> 00:42:02.120 line:0%
This case was assigned by the Grand Empress Dowager

00:42:02.120 --> 00:42:04.280 line:0%
to be handled solely by the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:42:04.280 --> 00:42:05.670 line:0%
I know what to do.

00:42:06.030 --> 00:42:07.670 line:0%
You just need to observe,

00:42:07.960 --> 00:42:09.440 line:0%
and don't cause any trouble.

00:42:09.440 --> 00:42:11.370 line:0%
Otherwise, you'll be charged with

00:42:11.370 --> 00:42:13.240 line:0%
disrupting the proceedings.